 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "CombinatorialRigidity",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 / mathlib4 formalization of combinatorial rigidity theory. It began with **Laman's theorem** (Pollaczek-Geiringer 1927, Laman 1970): for `n ≥ 2`, a graph is generically rigid in the plane iff it contains a `(2, 3)`-tight spanning subgraph."
 },
